                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8e0566d-27f7-3cec-a883-e370dc29af16",
                        "entry_id": "4df19328-78b2-31c8-8737-55e108000ad6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a person who has recently died"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e7a6e8e-aad1-43bd-b4cd-e1594cf16673",
                                "sense_id": "d8e0566d-27f7-3cec-a883-e370dc29af16",
                                "text": "Изве́стие о кончи́не его́ неме́дленно пронесло́сь в ските́ и дости́гло монастыря́. Ближа́йшие к новопреста́вленному и кому́ сле́довало по чи́ну ста́ли убира́ть по дре́влему обря́ду те́ло его́, а вся бра́тия собрала́сь в собо́рную це́рковь.",
                                "translation": "The news of his death spread at once through the hermitage and reached the monastery. The nearest friends of the deceased and those whose duty it was from their position began to lay out the corpse according to the ancient ritual, and all the monks gathered together in the church.",
                                "english": "The news of his death spread at once through the hermitage and reached the monastery. The nearest friends of the deceased and those whose duty it was from their position began to lay out the corpse according to the ancient ritual, and all the monks gathered together in the church."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
